      "text": "A farewell for a hero.\n \nYesterday, we gathered to honor the life and sacrifice of Aviation Survival Technician 2nd Class Tyler Jaggers. We remember not only his final act of courage, but his dedication as a mentor, leader, son and partner. A recipient of the Distinguished Flying Cross, Jaggers’ commitment to his crew and selfless service will forever inspire us. While we mourn his passing, his legacy lives on in the lives he saved and the sacred trust he fulfilled – so others may live.\n \n@USCGPACAREA @USCGNorthwest",
      "text_resolved": "A farewell for a hero.\n \nYesterday, we gathered to honor the life and sacrifice of Aviation Survival Technician 2nd Class Tyler Jaggers. We remember not only his final act of courage, but his dedication as a mentor, leader, son and partner. A recipient of the Distinguished Flying Cross, Jaggers’ commitment to his crew and selfless service will forever inspire us. While we mourn his passing, his legacy lives on in the lives he saved and the sacred trust he fulfilled – so others may live.\n \n@USCGPACAREA @USCGNorthwest",
